			"widgets_values":[
				"A vibrant and dynamic 618 Shopping Festival promotional poster featuring the iconic red and white color palette of JD.com, designed with a bold 3D illustration style that blends commercial realism with playful graphic elements. The composition follows a dynamic diagonal layout where the visual energy flows from the bottom left corner upwards to the top right, creating a sense of forward momentum and excitement, with generous negative space utilized in the upper right quadrant to accommodate key marketing copy without cluttering the visual field.\n\nThe central hero element is the official JD.com mascot, a cheerful anthropomorphic dog rendered in high-fidelity 3D with glossy fur textures and expressive features. The dog is depicted in a dynamic pose, perhaps jumping or sliding forward with a joyful expression, wearing a bright red cap or holding a golden shopping bag, emphasizing the shopping theme. The fur should have a soft, plush texture with subtle directional lighting to create depth, while the eyes and nose are shiny and reflective to capture attention. Surrounding the mascot are floating abstract geometric shapes and shopping-related icons like price tags, lightning bolts, and shopping carts, all rendered in varying shades of red, white, and electric blue to reinforce the festival identity and add visual interest.\n\nThe background environment is a stylized abstract stage that mimics a digital shopping mall or a celebratory marketplace, constructed with layered planes of deep red and gradient crimson to create a sense of spatial depth and richness. Subtle decorative elements such as floating confetti, sparkling stars, and semi-transparent glass shards are scattered throughout the mid-ground to enhance the festive atmosphere. The background includes a large, faint silhouette of a shopping cityscape or digital data streams at the bottom to suggest the scale of the online event, while soft radial gradients and ambient volumetric light rays emanate from the center, making the main subject pop against the rich backdrop.\n\nThe text design section is strategically placed in the lower third and upper right areas, with the main title \"618\" rendered in a massive, bold, sans-serif typeface using a gradient of metallic gold and fiery red to symbolize premium value and excitement. The text features a thick white stroke and a slight 3D bevel effect to ensure legibility against the busy background, accompanied by smaller sub-text detailing discount information like \"50% OFF\" or \"Free Shipping\" in crisp white letters with a soft drop shadow. Additional call-to-action phrases are arranged in a balanced grid using clean, modern fonts, ensuring the hierarchy of information is clear and the eye is guided naturally from the mascot to the promotional offers.\n\nThe lighting and rendering effects are meticulously crafted to maximize visual impact, utilizing a strong directional key light from the top left to illuminate the mascot's face and create dramatic highlights on its glossy fur and the metallic text. Soft rim lighting outlines the subject to separate it from the red background, while volumetric god rays pierce through the scene, adding a magical and ethereal quality. Subtle lens flares, bokeh effects, and sparkling particle effects of golden dust and red light particles float around the composition, enhancing the sense of celebration and energy. The materials are rendered with hyper-realistic details, showing smooth gradients on the fur, reflective surfaces on the text and props, and a slight glass sheen on the background elements to create a cohesive and polished look.\n\nThe overall atmosphere of the poster is one of intense energy, warmth, and urgency, perfectly capturing the spirit of the 618 Shopping Festival. The dominant red color scheme evokes feelings of passion, excitement, and prosperity, while the playful mascot injects a sense of fun and approachability. The combination of 3D rendering, dynamic composition, and strategic lighting creates a visually stunning and commercially effective design that instantly communicates the value proposition of the shopping event, aiming to entice viewers to click and shop immediately."
